From 0f7f1fabed4d8f1407b1bf89ceef904931166308 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PRIME B360M-C port <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 02:45:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] superio/nuvoton: Add NCT6793D

Add a driver for the Nuvoton NCT6793D, found on e.g. the ASUS PRIME
B360M-C. It is modeled on the NCT6796D driver: same configuration mode
entry/exit keys (0x87 0x87 / 0xaa), same logical device layout for the
devices coreboot cares about (parallel port, UART A/B, KBC, CIR, ACPI,
hardware monitor) and the generic Super I/O SSDT generator.

LDN 0x12 is included because the vendor firmware of the ASUS PRIME
B360M-C programs register 0xeb in it. LDNs 0x11 and 0x15, which exist on
the NCT6796D, are left out since their presence on the NCT6793D has not
been confirmed.

Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
